	"`/copy code` grabs the last code block to your clipboard — `/copy cmd` grabs the last shell/python command":
		"`/copy code` 将最后一个代码块复制到剪贴板 — `/copy cmd` 复制最后一条 shell/python 命令",
	"`/force read` pins the next turn to one specific tool when the model keeps reaching for the wrong one":
		"当模型一直选错工具时，`/force read` 会将下一轮固定到某个特定工具上",
	"`/shake` rips heavy tool results out of context to reclaim tokens without a full /compact — `/shake images` drops just images":
		"`/shake` 将大量工具结果从上下文中剥离以回收 token，无需完整 /compact — `/shake images` 只丢弃图像",
	'`omp disable` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin disable <name@marketplace>` to disable a plugin, or run `omp launch disable` if you meant to send "disable" as a prompt.':
		'`omp disable` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin disable <name@marketplace>` 禁用插件；若您本意是将 "disable" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch disable`。',
	'`omp discover` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin discover [marketplace]` to browse available plugins, or run `omp launch discover` if you meant to send "discover" as a prompt.':
		'`omp discover` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin discover [marketplace]` 浏览可用插件；若您本意是将 "discover" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch discover`。',
	'`omp enable` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin enable <name@marketplace>` to enable a plugin, or run `omp launch enable` if you meant to send "enable" as a prompt.':
		'`omp enable` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin enable <name@marketplace>` 启用插件；若您本意是将 "enable" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch enable`。',
	'`omp extensions` is not a management command. Use `omp plugin list` / `omp plugin install`, or run `omp launch extensions` if you meant to send "extensions" as a prompt.':
		'`omp extensions` 不是管理命令。请使用 `omp plugin list` / `omp plugin install`；若您本意是将 "extensions" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch extensions`。',
	'`omp list` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin list` to list installed plugins, or run `omp launch list` if you meant to send "list" as a prompt.':
		'`omp list` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin list` 列出已安装的插件；若您本意是将 "list" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch list`。',
	'`omp marketplace` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin marketplace <add|remove|update|list>` to manage marketplaces, or run `omp launch marketplace` if you meant to send "marketplace" as a prompt.':
		'`omp marketplace` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin marketplace <add|remove|update|list>` 管理市场；若您本意是将 "marketplace" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch marketplace`。',
	"`omp models find` requires a search substring, e.g. `omp models find minimax`":
		"`omp models find` 需要提供搜索子字符串，例如 `omp models find minimax`",
	'`omp remove` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin uninstall <name>` to remove a plugin, or run `omp launch remove` if you meant to send "remove" as a prompt.':
		'`omp remove` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin uninstall <name>` 移除插件；若您本意是将 "remove" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch remove`。',
	'`omp uninstall` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin uninstall <name@marketplace>` to remove a plugin, or run `omp launch uninstall` if you meant to send "uninstall" as a prompt.':
		'`omp uninstall` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin uninstall <name@marketplace>` 卸载插件；若您本意是将 "uninstall" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch uninstall`。',
	'`omp upgrade` is not a top-level command. Use `omp plugin upgrade [name@marketplace]` to upgrade plugins, or run `omp launch upgrade` if you meant to send "upgrade" as a prompt.':
		'`omp upgrade` 不是顶级命令。请使用 `omp plugin upgrade [name@marketplace]` 升级插件；若您本意是将 "upgrade" 作为提示词发送，请运行 `omp launch upgrade`。',
